称为生物风险控制措施。

28
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:54,600
Let us look back briefly on this description of the flow.
我们简要回顾一下这个流程的说明。

29
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:59,120
So we commence with hazard identification.
我们从危害识别开始。

30
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:01,360
We identify the hazards.
我们识别各种危害。

31
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:04,320
We then conduct a risk assessment
然后进行风险评估，

32
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:07,420
and categorize our biological agent
把生物因子归入

33
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:09,560
into the respective risk group.
相应的危险度等级。

34
00:02:09,580 --> 00:02:13,340
We also conduct a risk assessment using a risk matrix
我们还会像前面讨论过的那样，

35
00:02:13,340 --> 00:02:16,020
