是污水处理系统，

113
00:06:29,380 --> 00:06:32,060
which is responsible for the disposal
它负责处理

114
00:06:32,060 --> 00:06:33,860
of all the wastes and liquids
从你们设施中排出的

115
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:36,100
