所有废物和液体。

116
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:38,860
Then you look at the HEPA filtration system.
然后你要考虑HEPA过滤系统。

117
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:41,340
Now, this also adds to your facility
这也会扩大你们的设施，

118
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:43,700
as you will have to develop
因为你们必须另外

119
00:06:43,700 --> 00:06:46,820
or design two additional floors,
建设或设计两层楼，

120
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:51,220
which is to house the HEPA air filtration system
用来安置HEPA空气过滤系统

121
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:53,620
and your effluent disposal system.
和污水处理系统。

122
00:06:53,620 --> 00:06:56,180
So a lab basically gets converted
所以一个实验室基本上就变成了

123
00:06:56,180 --> 00:06:58,020
into a three-story facility.
一座三层的设施。

124
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:01,740
Then you have your biological safety cabinet,
然后是生物安全柜，

125
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:03,900
which is an essential equipment.
这是必备设备。

126
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:06,380
This biological agent must be hard ducted
这台生物安全柜必须硬管连接

127
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:08,580
into the HEPA filtration system
到HEPA过滤系统，

128
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:12,620
and the exhaust released into the environment
废气经过滤后

129
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:14,060
after filtration.
排放到环境中。

130
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:18,260
You can now bring in your personnel
现在你可以把人员

131
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,980
and your animals in this facility,
和动物引入这个设施，

132
00:07:20,980 --> 00:07:25,030
your experimental animals,
也就是你的实验动物，

133
00:07:25,030 --> 00:07:28,230
and your directional airflow is set into place
定向气流也已经布置到位，

134
00:07:28,230 --> 00:07:33,240
as well as the effluent disposal system.
污水处理系统也已就位。

135
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,760
So you have directional airflow,
这样就有了定向气流，

136
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:37,360
air which enters the facility is filtered
进入设施的空气经过过滤，

137
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:40,360
